  "details": "VRC Light Volumes is a voxel based light probes replacement for VRChat.\n\nhttps://github.com/REDSIM/VRCLightVolumes\n\nOnce it's introduced to avatar shaders, their appearance would be amazingly improve in appropriate worlds. Major shaders like lilToon and Poiyomi already support this system in the latest version.\n\nIt would be great if Toon Standard also support this. Mobile users also can get benefits.\n\nShader developers documentation:\n\nhttps://github.com/REDSIM/VRCLightVolumes/blob/main/Documentation/ForShaderDevelopers.md\n\nJapanese summary:\n\nToon StandardでVRC Light Volumesをサポートしてほしいという要望。MobileプラットフォームでもVRC Light Volumesを利用できるようになる。",
